        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, at Mini CHP plant, allocation energy</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, at Mini CHP plant, allocation energy
The multioutput-process 'natural gas, burned in Mini-BHKW, allocation energy' delivers the coproducts 'heat, at Mini-BHKW, allocation energy' and 'electricity, at Mini-BHKW, allocation energy'.;
UUID: bc7a3319-a164-32fe-8a87-89682c574d71
The module includes fuel input, infrastructure, emissions to air, and substances needed for operation.
Location: Could be used for central European conditions.
Technology: Specific manufacturer (Ecopower in Switzerland)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Manufacturer information. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bc7a3319-a164-32fe-8a87-89682c574d71.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
